@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Account Deletion";
}

<article class="legal-page">
    <h1>TryOutSpot Account Deletion Instructions</h1>
    <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> May 15, 2026</p>

    <p>
        TryOutSpot provides a way for users to request deletion of their account and personal data.
        This page is provided to satisfy Meta OAuth app data deletion instruction requirements.
    </p>

    <h2>How To Request Account Deletion</h2>
    <p>You can request account deletion using either method below:</p>
    <ol>
        <li>
            Sign in to your TryOutSpot account, open Account Settings, and submit the account deletion
            request from the account management section.
        </li>
        <li>
            Email us at <a href="mailto:ewhitfield@midamserv.com">ewhitfield@midamserv.com</a> using the
            email address associated with your TryOutSpot account and include "Delete My Account" in the subject line.
        </li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Verification Process</h2>
    <p>
        To protect account security, we may verify your identity before processing a deletion request.
        If additional verification is required, TryOutSpot support will contact you using your
        account email address.
    </p>

    <h2>What Is Deleted</h2>
    <p>
        After a verified deletion request is processed, TryOutSpot deletes or de-identifies account data
        associated with your profile, including user profile details and platform activity records that
        are not required to be retained.
    </p>

    <h2>What May Be Retained</h2>
    <p>
        Certain records may be retained when required for legal, security, fraud-prevention, dispute,
        payment, tax, audit, or regulatory compliance obligations. Retained records are limited to what
        is necessary for those purposes.
    </p>

    <h2>Processing Timeline</h2>
    <p>
        TryOutSpot works to complete verified deletion requests promptly. Most requests are processed
        within 30 days of verification.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
        For questions about account deletion or privacy requests, contact
        <a href="mailto:ewhitfield@midamserv.com">ewhitfield@midamserv.com</a>.
    </p>
</article>
